    "created_at": "2017-04-06T06:34:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-04-06T06:34:41Z",
    "body": "Oh, now I see what you mean. Because of the active check's in Blink's implementation, that would be a no-op, it wouldn't even fire a fullscreenerror event. (One could try, but we don't dispatch events in inactive documents, which I assume is also not accounted for by any standard.)",
